[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]
A SnowRunner-style [b]H-pattern manual shifter with a clutch[/b] for Over the Hill. Hold the clutch, move the right stick through a real H-gate, release the clutch and the gear engages.

[quote]Unofficial fan mod. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Funselektor. Gamepad only.[/quote]

[size=4][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install MelonLoader into the game folder and start the game once.
[*]Put [b]HShifter.dll[/b] in [b]<game folder>\Mods[/b].
[*]Start the game. Settings > Controls > Automatic / Manual now offers [b]H-Shifter[/b].
[/list]
Settings are stored in [b]UserData\HShifter.cfg[/b]. You can also edit them in-game with [url=https://github.com/Probastian/oth-modconfigurator]oth-modconfigurator[/url].

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Clutch[/b] (default [b]L1[/b]): while held, the car drops to neutral and the right stick moves a physical gear lever. Release it and the gear under the lever engages immediately; throttle held through the shift keeps working.
[*][b]A real gate[/b]: the lever travels in the direction you push the stick, along rails only, and stops at the gear slots. N is simply "not in a slot". Crossing between columns is forgiving.
[*][b]High / Low range[/b]: gate layout [1L 2L] [1H 2H] [R]. Moving into an L or H slot also switches the transfer case.
[*][b]Native HUD overlay[/b] drawn with the game's own style, showing the gate and lever.
[*][b]Settings > Controls integration[/b]: the game's Automatic / Manual selector gets a third option, H-Shifter.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Over the Hill (Steam)
[*][url=https://github.com/LavaGang/MelonLoader]MelonLoader[/url] 0.7.x (tested with 0.7.3 Open-Beta)
[*]A gamepad and a vehicle with a manual gearbox
[/list]

[size=4][b]Multiplayer[/b][/size]
Local input only. Single player / hosting: any gear, including N, is set directly on your own car. Joined as a client: only the game's own gear up / gear down presses are sent, so N may be unreachable.

[size=4][b]Bug reports and contributions[/b][/size]
Please report bugs using [url=https://github.com/Probastian/oth-hshifter/issues]GitHub issues[/url]. Pull requests and forks are welcome. Source code and MIT license: [url=https://github.com/Probastian/oth-hshifter]github.com/Probastian/oth-hshifter[/url]
